# dev-registry owners — TEMPLATE (committed). Copy to the private mirror:
#     cp system/references/dev-registry.owners.example local/references/dev-registry.owners
# then list YOUR git orgs / usernames / author-name fragments — one regex per line.
# A checkout whose git remote or commit-author matches any of these is classified "eigen".
# Lines starting with # are ignored; patterns are joined with | (extended regex, case-insensitive).
# If this file is absent, nothing is auto-classified "eigen" by remote (safe shareable default).
#
# your-github-org
# your-gitea-host
# your-username
